    "question_text": "A 25-year-old restrained driver is involved in a head-on motor vehicle crash. Two weeks later, the individual complains of pain and paresthesias in the thigh. No loss of muscle strength is noted on examination, but there is a decrease in sensation in the symptomatic thigh. Which neuropathy is the most likely etiology for this patient’s complaint?",
