    "source_exam": "ABPMR MOC100 (September 2015 release)",
    "question_text": "A 28-year-old patient with T2 paraplegia complains of symptoms of autonomic dysreflexia during her bowel routine. Which treatment is the best next step?",
    "option_a": "CO2 suppositories",
    "option_b": "Topical anesthetic application",
