    "question_text": "A 33-year-old cab driver was involved in a rear-end motor vehicle crash and hit his knee against the dashboard. He presents with a six-week history of knee pain, a positive posterior drawer sign, and difficulty walking down inclines. What is the most important muscle group to strengthen?",
