    "source_exam": "ABPMR PM&R100 Part I (June 2015 release)",
    "question_text": "A 50-year-old retired army paratrooper with diabetes complains of pain on ambulation due to degenerative joint disease in his right hip. You prescribe a single cane to",
    "option_a": "decrease weight-bearing forces across the arthritic hip joint",
