    "id": "pmr100-81",
    "source_exam": "ABPMR PM&R100 Part I (June 2015 release)",
    "question_text": "A patient with a recent traumatic brain injury (TBI) developed right lower extremity spasticity and knee flexion contracture which has been treated unsuccessfully with range of motion (ROM) and positioning. What is the next step in the management of this patient?",
