    "id": "pmr100-99",
    "source_exam": "ABPMR PM&R100 Part I (June 2015 release)",
    "question_text": "A patient presents with progressive, unrelenting low back pain. Two months ago, an uncomplicated diskectomy successfully relieved the patient’s radicular symptoms. Which imaging study would most likely confirm the diagnosis at this time?",
    "option_a": "X-ray of lumbosacral spine",
