    "question_text": "A 35 year old man with history of RRMS presents for follow up. He complains of fatigue, urinary urgency and weakness in his legs. His exam shows hyperreflexia and 4/5 weakness in the legs. He is on interferon-beta and cannot tolerate the side effects. What are not the typical side effects?",
