    "question_text": "A 6 month old baby presents with recent onset of episodes of jerking. The child wakes up in the morning with contraction of his body and then tonic posturing of the trunk and all limbs lasting a few seconds. This happens a few times in clusters. When the jerking stops the baby cries and is slightly lethargic appearing. What do you expect to see on EEG? 4 Epilepsy",
