    "question_text": "A 63 year old man presents with a history of episodic events of altered awareness. He says prior to the moment of altered behavior and awareness he notes that he has a sense of fear and anxiety. His wife notes he then stares blankly and stiffens up in the right upper extremity. He is unresponsive for about 1–2 minutes. When this passes he is very tired and amnestic about the event. Where does his seizure originate?",
