    "question_text": "A 45 year-old woman presents with abnormal head posture. She reports that she tilts her head forward and to the right. She feels like there is a pressure to hold her head in this position. She has a trick where she is able to correct this position by touching her chin lightly on the left. She has previously been diagnosed with cervical dystonia. You suggest botulinum toxin injections as treatment. Which of the following is the mechanism of action of botulinum toxin?",
