    "question_text": "Your patient with breast cancer was treated with chemotherapy and soon after developed painful numbness and tingling, burning sensations in her feet. Her exam shows decreased reflexes in her legs and decreased proprioception in the feet. Which medication may be at fault?",
    "option_a": "Doxorubicin",
