    "question_text": "A 64 year-old man with history of cancer presents with headaches and some numbness in the right arm and leg. He has not noted much weakness but on exam you do note some mild distal weakness in the right hand and foot with a pronator drift on the right. Out of the answer choices, which of these primary cancers is most likely to metastasize to the brain?",
