    "question_text": "A 34 year-old man with epilepsy comes to the emergency room because over the last two days he is confused and cannot walk without falling. On examination he is disoriented to year, has pronounced nystagmus with central gaze, slurred speech, wide-based station, and ataxic gait. Urine drug screen is normal and alcohol level is normal. CT brain is non-focal. Toxic levels of which antiepileptic medication has caused this scenario?",
